{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Fetter","html":"<article id='sn1.64'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.64 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 1.64 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>7. Addhavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>7. Overcome </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Saṁyojanasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Fetter </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kiṁsu saṁyojano loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“What fetters the world? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kiṁsu tassa vicāraṇaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>How does it travel about? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kissassu vippahānena, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>With the giving up of what </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>nibbānaṁ iti vuccatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>is extinguishment spoken of?” </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nandīsaṁyojano loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Delight fetters the world. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vitakkassa vicāraṇaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>It travels about by means of thought. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Taṇhāya vippahānena, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>With the giving up of craving </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>nibbānaṁ iti vuccatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>extinguishment is spoken of.” </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
